      "page": 89,
      "ruku": 71,
      "hizbQuarter": 35,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 565,
      "text": "There are some[51] among you who lag behind [from the battle]; then if a calamity befalls you, he will say, “Allah has blessed me that I was not present with them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 89,
      "ruku": 71,
      "hizbQuarter": 35,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 566,
      "text": "But if some bounty comes to you from Allah[52], he will surely say – as if there had never been any affection between you and him – “Oh, I wish I had been with them, so I could have made a great gain.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
